/sc.wklcdn.com/wikiloc/images/wikiloc.png?v=3.0" alt="Wikiloc"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><font style="font-size:14pt;color:#347235"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592#wp-92547593">Monumento 4 mori</a></font><br/> by <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/user.do?id=6736771">luca bigoni</a></td></tr><tr><td width="40"><img src="https://sc.wklcdn.com/wikiloc/images/pictograms/90.png" alt=""/></td><td align="left"><b>Coordinates (lat,lon):</b> 43.549512,10.304784<br/><b>Elevation:</b> 1 meters<br/></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592/photo-60482679"><img width="60" height="60" src="http://www.wikiloc.com//image_224/6736771/92547593/60482679_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;<a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592/photo-60482680"><img width="60" height="60" src="http://www.wikiloc.com//image_224/6736771/92547593/60482680_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">Il monumento sorge davanti alla piccola darsena che il granduca Ferdinando I de' Medici fece scavare sul finire del Cinquecento per ampliare... <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592#wp-92547593">">read more &rarr;</a></td></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="2"><br/><a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/upload.do"><b>Upload your waypoints to wikiloc.com &rarr;</b></a></td></tr></table>]]></description><styleUrl>#waypointStyle</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>10.304784,43.549512,1.6</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><Snippet maxLines="0"/><name>Fortezza Vecchia</name><description><![CDATA[<table width="400" style="color:#666"><tr><td colspan="2" align="left"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com"><img src="https://sc.wklcdn.com/wikiloc/images/wikiloc.png?v=3.0" alt="Wikiloc"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><font style="font-size:14pt;color:#347235"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592#wp-92547594">Fortezza Vecchia</a></font><br/> by <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/user.do?id=6736771">luca bigoni</a></td></tr><tr><td width="40"><img src="https://sc.wklcdn.com/wikiloc/images/pictograms/125.png" alt=""/></td><td align="left"><b>Coordinates (lat,lon):</b> 43.551927,10.302365<br/><b>Elevation:</b> 5 meters<br/></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592/photo-60482687"><img width="60" height="60" src="http://www.wikiloc.com//image_224/6736771/92547594/60482687_tn.jpg" alt=""/></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">La Fortezza Vecchia presenta una forma asimmetrica ed è costituita da tre bastioni (l'Ampolletta rivolto verso la città, la Canaviglia verso... <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592#wp-92547594">">read more &rarr;</a></td></tr><tr><td align="center" colspan="2"><br/><a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/upload.do"><b>Upload your waypoints to wikiloc.com &rarr;</b></a></td></tr></table>]]></description><styleUrl>#waypointStyle</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>10.302365,43.551927,5.9</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><Snippet maxLines="0"/><name>Fortezza nuova</name><description><![CDATA[<table width="400" style="color:#666"><tr><td colspan="2" align="left"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com"><img src="https://sc.wklcdn.com/wikiloc/images/wikiloc.png?v=3.0" alt="Wikiloc"></a></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"><font style="font-size:14pt;color:#347235"><a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/trekking-cittadino-livorno-centro-92547592#wp-92547595">Fortezza nuova</a></font><br/> by <a style="color:#2B60DE" href="https://www.wikiloc.com/wikiloc/user.do?id=6736771">luca bigoni</a></td></tr><